<title>LATVIA: SAULES BANK 5-MO PROFIT 478,000 LATS.</title>
<headline>SAULES BANK 5-MO PROFIT 478,000 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saules Bank said on Monday that its profits after the first five months were 478,000 lats and assets were 52.19 million lats.</p>
<p>The bank did not provide any comparative figures for the five months figures.</p>
<p>In a statement, it also said that it had deposits of 33.60 million lats including deposts from individuals of 10.14 million lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
